msgstr "弾薬(105mm)"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\ammo_types.json
msgid "120mm shell"
msgstr "弾薬(120mm)"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\ammo_types.json
msgid "155mm shell"
msgstr "弾薬(155mm)"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\ammo_types.json
msgid "25x137mm"
msgstr "弾薬(25x137mm)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "large artillery casing"
msgid_plural "large artillery casings"
msgstr[0] "空薬莢(155mm)"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "25x137mm ammo belt"
msgid_plural "25x137mm ammo belts"
msgstr[0] "弾帯(25x137mm)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "25x137mm autocannon belt linkage"
msgid_plural "25x137mm autocannon belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "弾帯接続金具(25x137mm)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "25x137mm M792 HEI"
msgid_plural "25x137mm M792 HEI"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/M792 HEI)"

#. ~ Description of "25x137mm M792 HEI"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 25x137mm autocannon round, high explosive incendiary.  Designed for use "
"against unarmored vehicles and to suppress infantry."
msgstr ""
"25x137mm 焼夷榴弾です。 非装甲車両への使用と歩兵制圧用に設計されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "25x137mm M791 APDS"
msgid_plural "25x137mm M791 APDS"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/M791 APDS)"

#. ~ Description of "25x137mm M791 APDS"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 25x137mm autocannon round using an armor-piercing, discarding sabot with a "
"tungsten penetrator.  Used primarily against light armored vehicles and "
"aerial targets."
msgstr ""
"25x137mm 装弾筒付徹甲弾です。タングステン弾芯を使用した自動機関砲弾です。 主"
"に軽装甲車両と航空目標に対して使用されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 25x137mm"
msgid_plural "reloaded 25x137mm"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 25x137mm"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 25x137mm autocannon round with its primer replaced, and loaded with a "
"basic lead projectile.  Not as effective as the real thing, but still fairly "
"potent."
msgstr ""
"25x137mm 自動機関砲弾です。雷管を交換し、基本的な鉛弾を装填したものです。 本"
"物ほど効果的ではありませんが、それでもかなりの威力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 25x137mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "reloaded 25x137mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/黒色火薬/手詰め)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 25x137mm HE"
msgid_plural "reloaded 25x137mm HE"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/HE/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 25x137mm HE"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 25x137mm autocannon round with its primer replaced, loaded with a homemade "
"explosive round.  Useful against lightly armored targets, though not as "
"effective as the real thing."
msgstr ""
"25x137mm 自動機関砲弾です。雷管を交換し、自家製爆薬を装填したものです。 軽装"
"甲目標に有効ですが、本物ほど効果的ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 25x137mm HE, black powder"
msgid_plural "reloaded 25x137mm HE, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(25x137mm/HE/黒色火薬/手詰め)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "105mm M456 HEAT"
msgid_plural "105mm M456 HEAT"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/M456 HEAT)"

#. ~ Description of "105mm M456 HEAT"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 105mm High Explosive Anti Tank round, designed for older models of tank "
"held in reserve up until the world was on the brink of ending.  Now that the "
"world has gone and ended, it still packs quite a punch."
msgstr ""
"105mm 対戦車榴弾です。世界が終末の瀬戸際に立つまで予備として保管されていた旧"
"式戦車用に設計されたものです。 世界が終わってしまった今でも、その威力は変わり"
"ません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "105mm M833 APFSDS"
msgid_plural "105mm M833 APFSDS"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/M833 APFSDS)"

#. ~ Description of "105mm M833 APFSDS"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 105mm Armor-Piercing Fin-Stabilized Discarding Sabot round, no longer "
"commonly used except for hastily supplying obsolete tanks.  Brought out of "
"mothballs or not, its depleted uranium projectile will still give whatever "
"it hits a bad time."
msgstr ""
"105mm 離脱装弾筒付翼安定式徹甲弾です。現在では旧式戦車への急場しのぎの補給を"
"除いて一般的には使用されていません。 保管庫から引っ張り出されたものであって"
"も、その劣化ウラン弾芯は命中した標的に深刻な損害を与えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 105mm slug"
msgid_plural "makeshift 105mm slug"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/簡易/ｽﾗｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift 105mm slug"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 105mm shell with a new electric primer installed, loaded with a large "
"handmade slug.  While hardly ideal, it packs quite a punch."
msgstr ""
"新しい電気雷管を取り付け、大型の手作りスラッグ弾を装填した105mm砲弾です。 理"
"想的とは言い難いものの、相当な威力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 105mm slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "makeshift 105mm slug, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/簡易/ｽﾗｸﾞ/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 105mm HE"
msgid_plural "reloaded 105mm HE"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/HE/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 105mm HE"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 105mm shell with a new electric primer installed, loaded with a homemade "
"explosive round.  Obsolete or not, it packs quite a punch."
msgstr ""
"新しい電気雷管を取り付け、自家製爆薬を装填した105mm砲弾です。 旧式であっても"
"相当な威力を持ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 105mm HE, black powder"
msgid_plural "reloaded 105mm HE, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/HE/黒色火薬/手詰め)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "120mm M830A1 HEAT"
msgid_plural "120mm M830A1 HEAT"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/M830A1 HEAT)"

#. ~ Description of "120mm M830A1 HEAT"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 120mm High Explosive Anti Tank round.  Packs an explosive punch that could "
"ruin anyone's whole day."
msgstr "120mm 対戦車榴弾です。 成形炸薬の指向性爆発が甚大な被害を与えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "120mm M829A3 APFSDS"
msgid_plural "120mm M829A3 APFSDS"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/M829A3 APFSDS)"

#. ~ Description of "120mm M829A3 APFSDS"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 120mm Armor-Piercing Fin-Stabilized Discarding Sabot round.  Uses a "
"depleted uranium projectile to give whatever it hits a really bad day."
msgstr ""
"120mm 離脱装弾筒付翼安定式徹甲弾です。 劣化ウラン弾芯を使用し、命中した標的に"
"壊滅的な損害を与えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 120mm shot"
msgid_plural "reloaded 120mm shot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 120mm shot"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift, rebuilt 120mm shell with a new electric primer installed, "
"filled with a large amount of buckshot.  Effectively similar to no-longer-"
"produced canister shot, but of lower quality."
msgstr ""
"簡易に再装填された120mm砲弾で、新しい電気雷管を取り付け、大量の散弾を詰め込ん"
"でいます。 すでに生産されていないキャニスター弾に似ていますが、品質は劣りま"
"す。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 120mm shot, black powder"
msgid_plural "makeshift 120mm shot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/簡易/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 120mm slug"
msgid_plural "reloaded 120mm slug"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/ｽﾗｸﾞ/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 120mm slug"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift, rebuilt 120mm shell with a new electric primer installed, "
"loaded with a large handmade slug.  While hardly ideal, it packs quite a "
"punch."
msgstr ""
"簡易に再装填された120mm砲弾で、新しい電気雷管を取り付け、大型の自作スラグ弾頭"
"を装填しています。 決して理想的とは言えませんが、相当な威力を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 120mm slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "makeshift 120mm slug, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/簡易/ｽﾗｸﾞ/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 120mm HE"
msgid_plural "reloaded 120mm HE"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/HE/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 120mm HE"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift, rebuilt 120mm shell with a new electric primer installed, "
"loaded with a homemade explosive round.  Packs an explosive punch that could "
"ruin anyone's whole day."
msgstr ""
"簡易に再装填された120mm砲弾で、新しい電気雷管を取り付け、自作の炸薬弾頭を装填"
"しています。 強烈な爆発力により甚大な被害を与えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 120mm HE, black powder"
msgid_plural "reloaded 120mm HE, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(120mm/HE/黒色火薬/手詰め)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "155mm M712 HEAT"
msgid_plural "155mm M712 HEAT"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/M712 HEAT)"

#. ~ Description of "155mm M712 HEAT"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 155mm High Explosive Anti Tank round, normally laser-guided.  Separate-"
"loading, it comes with the requisite fuze installed, a propellant bag, and "
"percussion primer.  As its guidance feature requires a laser designator and "
"has a minimum range of 3 kilometers, using it for direct fire is an "
"astounding display of overkill."
msgstr ""
"155mm 対戦車榴弾です。通常はレーザー誘導が必要です。分離装薬式で、必要な信"
"管、装薬袋、撃発雷管が付属しています。 誘導機能にはレーザー指示装置が必要で最"
"小射程が3キロメートルのため、直接射撃で使用するのは信じがたいオーバーキルと言"
"えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "155mm M795 frag"
msgid_plural "155mm M795 frag"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/M795 破片)"

#. ~ Description of "155mm M795 frag"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 155mm High Explosive Fragmentation round.  Separate-loading, it comes with "
"the requisite fuze installed, a propellant bag, and percussion primer.  "
"Designed to lob a heavy shell a long distance, using it direct-fire isn't "
"exactly ideal, but it'll still give anything near what you hit a seriously "
"bad time."
msgstr ""
"155mm 榴散弾です。分離装薬式で、必要な信管、装薬袋、撃発雷管が付属していま"
"す。 重い砲弾を長距離に投射するよう設計されているため直接射撃での使用は理想的"
"とは言えませんが、命中地点の周辺にあるものには何でも深刻な損害を与えるでしょ"
"う。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 155mm shot"
msgid_plural "makeshift 155mm shot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/簡易)"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift 155mm shot"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift separate-loading shotshell for 155mm.  Consists of a canister of "
"lead balls, a bag of propellant, and a replacement primer.  Effectively "
"turns a howitzer into a punt gun on steroids."
msgstr ""
"155mm散弾の簡易版です。鉛球を詰めた容器、装薬袋、交換式雷管で構成されていま"
"す。 榴弾砲をまるで強化された超大型の散弾銃に変えてしまう代物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 155mm shot, black powder"
msgid_plural "makeshift 155mm shot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/簡易/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 155mm slug"
msgid_plural "makeshift 155mm slug"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/簡易/ｽﾗｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift 155mm slug"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift separate-loading round for 155mm.  Consists of a large lead "
"ball, a bag of propellant, and a replacement primer.  Despite the lower "
"effectiveness, whatever it hits is sure to feel it."
msgstr ""
"155mm分離装填弾の簡易版です。大型の鉛球、装薬袋、交換式雷管で構成されていま"
"す。 効果は劣りますが、命中したものは確実にその威力を感じるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 155mm slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "makeshift 155mm slug, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/簡易/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 155mm HE"
msgid_plural "reloaded 155mm HE"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(150mm/HE/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "reloaded 155mm HE"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift separate-loading HE round for 155mm.  Consists of a homemade "
"explosive shell with fuze installed, a bag of propellant, and a replacement "
"primer.  Using it for direct-fire isn't ideal, but it should be more than "
"enough to ruin anyone's day."
msgstr ""
"簡易的な155mm用分離装薬式榴弾です。 信管付きの自作炸薬弾頭、装薬袋、交換用雷"
"管で構成されています。 直射には適していませんが、甚大な被害を与えるには十分す"
"ぎる威力を持っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reloaded 155mm HE, black powder"
msgid_plural "reloaded 155mm HE, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(150mm/HE/黒色火薬/手詰め)"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "155mm nuclear shell"
msgid_plural "155mm nuclear shell"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(155mm/核弾頭)"

#. ~ Description of "155mm nuclear shell"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift separate-loading round for 155mm, developed from experimental "
"designs.  Uses a propellant bag and replacement primer to fire a modified "
"mininuke, adapted to fit a howitzer.  Whatever would warrant such awesome "
"firepower would best be engaged from a safe distance."
msgstr ""
"実験的に作成された155mm分離装填弾です。装薬袋と交換式雷管を使用し、榴弾砲向け"
"に改造された小型核弾頭を発射します。 この恐るべき火力が必要とされる状況では、"
"十分に離れた距離から対処するべきでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "25mm casing"
msgid_plural "25mm casing"
msgstr[0] "空薬莢(25mm)"

#. ~ Description of "25mm casing"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "A canister from a spent 25mm shell."
msgstr "使用済み25mm弾の薬莢です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "105mm canister"
msgid_plural "105mm canister"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(105mm/ｷｬﾆｽﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "105mm canister"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "A canister from a spent 105mm shell, now an expensive paperweight."
msgstr "使用済み105mm砲弾の薬莢です。今では高価な文鎮になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "120mm case base"
msgid_plural "120mm case base"
msgstr[0] "弾薬基部(120mm)"

#. ~ Description of "120mm case base"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"The steel case base from a spent 120mm shell.  With combustible case walls "
"forming the bulk of the casing itself, what's left is now an expensive "
"paperweight."
msgstr ""
"発射済の120mm砲弾の鋼鉄製薬莢底部です。 薬莢の大部分は可燃性のため、残された"
"これは高価な文鎮にすぎません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 120mm canister"
msgid_plural "makeshift 120mm canister"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(125mm/簡易/ｷｬﾆｽﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift 120mm canister"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A spent 120mm case base converted into an improved casing, by welding new "
"case walls of appropriate dimensions to the base.  Hopefully the welds are "
"good, or else it might be a better fit for a pipe bomb instead."
msgstr ""
"発射済の120mm砲弾の薬莢の底部を流用し、適切な寸法の新しい薬莢壁を溶接して取り"
"付けた簡易薬莢です。 溶接がうまくいっていることを祈るべきで、そうでなければパ"
"イプ爆弾にでもした方がよいかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "electric primer"
msgid_plural "electric primer"
msgstr[0] "雷管(105mm/120mm戦車砲)"

#. ~ Description of "electric primer"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "Primer for a tank shell.  Seems to use an electric ignition."
msgstr "戦車砲弾の雷管です。 電気発火式のようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "artillery primer"
msgid_plural "artillery primer"
msgstr[0] "雷管(155mm)"

#. ~ Description of "artillery primer"
