#. ~ Description of gun "stripped-down 25mm cannon"
#. ~ Description of "stripped-down 25mm cannon"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"Modified from a M242 Bushmaster autocannon, this pared down weapon has been "
"altered into a makeshift anti-materiel rifle.  Its chain-driven mechanism "
"has been removed, reducing weight in exchange for converting it into a "
"single-shot design.  Still extremely bulky, requiring it to be deployed or "
"mounted on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"M242ブッシュマスター機関砲を改造して作られたもので、簡易的に対物ライフルに仕"
"立てられています。 チェーン駆動機構を取り外すことで単発式となり軽量化されてい"
"ますが、それでもなお非常にかさばるので射撃するには設置するか車両に搭載しなけ"
"ればなりません。"

