#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 25mm cannon"
msgid_plural "makeshift 25mm cannon"
msgstr[0] "簡易25mm機関砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "makeshift 25mm cannon"
#. ~ Description of "makeshift 25mm cannon"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift cannon crudely chambered for 25x137mm, with a short thick-walled "
"barrel and a breechblock fashioned out of hardened steel.  Very unreliable "
"and massively reduces performance, but simpler to install and easier to "
"repair.  Only holds a single shot, and must be deployed or mounted on a "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"25x157mm砲弾を発射できるよう無理に改造された簡易的な機関砲で、短い肉厚の砲身"
"と焼入れ鋼製の閉鎖機を備えています。 信頼性に欠け、性能も大幅に低下しますが、"
"設置が容易で修理もしやすいです。 単発式で電気点火方式を採用しており、車両に搭"
"載しなければ発射できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "M246 120mm tank gun"
msgid_plural "M246 120mm tank gun"
msgstr[0] "M246 120mm戦車砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "M246 120mm tank gun"
#. ~ Description of "M246 120mm tank gun"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A version of the Rheinmetall Rh-120, this 120mm cannon is most notably used "
"in the M1 Abhrams.  Uses electric ignition, and obviously needs to be "
"mounted on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"ラインメタル Rh-120の改良型で、この120mm砲はM1エイブラムス戦車に採用されたこ"
"とで知られています。 電気点火式で、当然ながら発射するには車両への搭載が必要で"
"す。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "XM246E1 autoloading tank gun"
msgid_plural "XM246E1 autoloading tank gun"
msgstr[0] "XM246E1自動装填式戦車砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "XM246E1 autoloading tank gun"
#. ~ Description of "XM246E1 autoloading tank gun"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"An experimental variant of the Rheinmetall Rh-120, this 120mm cannon is "
"equipped with a 5-round autoloader.  Uses electric ignition, and obviously "
"needs to be mounted on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"ラインメタルRh-120の実験型バリエーションで、5発分の自動装填装置を備えた120mm"
"戦車砲です。 電気点火方式を採用しており、もちろん車両に搭載しなければ発射でき"
"ません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "makeshift 120mm tank gun"
msgid_plural "makeshift 120mm tank gun"
msgstr[0] "簡易120mm戦車砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "makeshift 120mm tank gun"
#. ~ Description of "makeshift 120mm tank gun"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift cannon crudely chambered for 120mm tank shells, with a short "
"thick-walled barrel and a breechblock fashioned out of hardened steel.  Very "
"unreliable and massively reduces performance, but simpler to install and "
"easier to repair.  Only holds a single shot, uses electric ignition, and "
"must be mounted on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"120mm砲弾を発射できるよう無理に改造された簡易的な大砲で、短い肉厚の砲身と焼入"
"れ鋼製の閉鎖機を備えています。 信頼性に欠け、性能も大幅に低下しますが、設置が"
"容易で修理もしやすいです。 単発式で電気点火方式を採用しており、車両に搭載しな"
"ければ発射できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "M68 105mm tank gun"
msgid_plural "M68 105mm tank gun"
msgstr[0] "M68 105mm戦車砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "M68 105mm tank gun"
#. ~ Description of "M68 105mm tank gun"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A version of the Royal Ordinance L7, this 105mm rifled cannon is used in "
"various armored vehicles worldwide, many no longer in service, some still in "
"use, and some brought back out of reserve in the desperate last days before "
"the world ended.  Uses electric ignition, and obviously needs to be mounted "
"on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"世界各国の装甲車両で使用されていたロイヤル・オードナンス L7の改良型です。多く"
"は既に退役していますが一部は現在も使用中で、また一部は世界が終わる前の絶望的"
"な最後の日々に予備から復帰させられました。 電気点火式で、当然ながら発砲するに"
"は車両への搭載が必要です。"

