#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "M284 howitzer"
msgid_plural "M284 howitzer"
msgstr[0] "M284榴弾砲"

#. ~ Description of gun "M284 howitzer"
#. ~ Description of "M284 howitzer"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A 155mm cannon designed for self-propelled guns such as the M109.  Obviously "
"it needs to be mounted on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"M109自走砲などに搭載するために設計された155mm榴弾砲です。  当然ながら発射する"
"には車両への搭載が必要です。"

