#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "BGM-71F TOW Under Armor"
msgid_plural "BGM-71F TOW Under Armor"
msgstr[0] "対戦車ミサイル(GBM-71F TOW)"

#. ~ Description of gun "BGM-71F TOW Under Armor"
#. ~ Description of "BGM-71F TOW Under Armor"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A twin-tube launcher for anti-tank guided missiles, specifically designed "
"for vehicle use.  While fairly accurate, it isn't fire-and-forget.  "
"Obviously it needs to be mounted on a vehicle to fire."
msgstr ""
"対戦車誘導ミサイル用の双連装発射機で、車両搭載専用に設計されています。 狙いは"
"かなり正確ですが、撃ちっぱなし式ではありません。当然ながら発射するには車両へ"
"の搭載が必要です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "Artillery and Field Gunnery"
msgid_plural "copies of Artillery and Field Gunnery"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/砲兵と野砲)"

#. ~ Description of "Artillery and Field Gunnery"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A textbook on the history of modern artillery, with a number of "
"illustrations and excerpts from various field manuals.  A competent "
"handloader or mechanic might find additional uses for the more technical "
"parts of the text."
msgstr ""
"近代砲兵の歴史を扱った教科書で、多数の挿絵や各種野戦教範からの抜粋を含んでい"
"ます。 弾薬手詰や整備に熟練していれば、技術的な記述を応用できるかもしれませ"
"ん。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "XM246E1 monster tank gun"
msgid_plural "XM246E1 monster tank guns"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "XM246E1 monster tank gun"
#. ~ Description of "XM246E1 monster tank gun"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"This exists to alter the dispersion of the new tank drone.  This is a bug if "
"you find one of these."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "broken Mini-Tank UAFV"
msgid_plural "broken Mini-Tank UAFVs"
msgstr[0] "壊れた重装無人戦車"

#. ~ Description of "broken Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A hulking wreck of treads, composite plating, and cold robotic hatred.  "
"Hopefully won't ever be operational again, now only good for parts."
msgstr ""
"無限軌道と装甲板、冷酷な機械の意思でできた巨大な残骸です。 再稼働しないことを"
"願いながら、分解して部品を取り出せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "rubber caterpillar track"
msgid_plural "rubber caterpillar tracks"
msgstr[0] "キャタピラ(ゴム)"

#. ~ Description of "rubber caterpillar track"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A short, interlocking set of hard rubber tracks reinforced by stiff wire "
"held in place by a set of smaller wheels.  Similar with what you might see "
"used on light construction vehicles.  It's significantly stronger than "
"regular tires due to not being at risk of bursting; but is quite heavy."
msgstr ""
"硬質ゴム製のキャタピラで、硬いワイヤーで補強され、小型の車輪群によって保持さ"
"れる構造になっています。 小型建設車両でよく見られるタイプで、破裂の危険がない"
"ため通常のタイヤよりもはるかに頑丈ですが、その分重量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "steel caterpillar track"
msgid_plural "steel caterpillar tracks"
msgstr[0] "キャタピラ(鋼材)"

#. ~ Description of "steel caterpillar track"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A short, interlocking set of shaped steel tracks held in place by a set of "
"smaller wheels.  Similar with what you might see used on large construction "
"vehicles.  It's significantly stronger than regular tires due to not being "
"at risk of bursting; but is very heavy."
msgstr ""
"鋼材のキャタピラで、小型の車輪群によって保持される構造になっています。 大型建"
"設車両でよく見られるタイプで、破裂の危険がないため通常のタイヤよりもはるかに"
"頑丈ですが、その分非常に重いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "reinforced caterpillar track"
msgid_plural "reinforced caterpillar tracks"
msgstr[0] "キャタピラ(戦車)"

#. ~ Description of "reinforced caterpillar track"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid ""
"A short, interlocking set of shaped steel tracks held in place by a set of "
"smaller wheels.  Similar with what you might see used on APCs and armored "
"vehicles.  It's significantly stronger than regular tires due to not being "
"at risk of bursting; but is extremely heavy."
msgstr ""
"鋼材のキャタピラで、小型の車輪群によって保持される構造になっています。 装甲兵"
"員輸送車や装甲車両でよく見られるタイプで、破裂の危険がないため通常のタイヤよ"
"りもはるかに頑丈ですが、その分極めて重いです。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\missiondef.json
msgid "Supply Run"
msgstr "物資輸送"

#. ~ Description of mission "Supply Run"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The last of your tank's crew was heading to a helipad in the area in search "
"of supplies, and never returned.  They clearly didn't make it, and by now "
"it's probably overrun, but some fuel and ammo would be better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"あなたの戦車の最後の乗員が物資を求めてヘリポートへ向かいましたが、たどり着け"
"なかったのでしょう。戻ってはきませんでした。 今ごろは制圧されているはずです"
"が、それでも燃料や弾薬を少しでも確保できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\modinfo.json
msgid "Tankmod: Revived"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of MOD "Tankmod: Revived"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\modinfo.json
msgid ""
"The intended successor of my older, obsoleted Tanks and Other Vehicles mod."
msgstr "かつて廃止された戦車とその他の車両modの後継を目指しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
msgid "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
msgid_plural "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFVs"
msgstr[0] "重装無人戦車(XM246E1)"

#. ~ Description of monster "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
msgid ""
"An experimental, heavily armored UGV the size of a small vehicle, its "
"structure dominated by a bulky 120mm main gun.  It trundles along on armored "
"treads, ponderous yet implacable.  If it's taking aim at you… run."
msgstr ""
"小型車ほどの大きさを持つ実験的な重装甲無人戦車で、巨大な120mm主砲がその構造の"
"大部分を占めています。 装甲履帯が重々しくも容赦なく進み続けます。 もし狙われ"
"たら……逃げてください。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes!"
msgstr "%s が爆発した！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
msgid "The mini-tank fires its 120mm gun!"
msgstr "無人戦車が120mmを発射！"

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
msgid "\"120mm HEAT, up.  Targeting.  On the way.\""
msgstr "\"120mm HEAT弾、装填完了。 照準中。 発射用意\""

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "XM246E1 Mini-Tank UAFV"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\monsters.json
msgid "a hollow click!"
msgstr "カチッ！"

#. ~ Profession name for male
