msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Tank Driver"
msgstr "戦車操縦士"

#. ~ Description of profession "Tank Driver" for male
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in charge of driving the tank, but without a commander it's a lot "
"harder to get a clear picture of what's around you."
msgstr ""
"あなたは戦車の操縦を担当していましたが、車長がいなくなっては周囲の状況を正確"
"に把握するのは困難です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\professions.json
