#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\snippets.json
msgid ""
"EXPERIMENTAL TANKS TO ENTER FIELD TESTS - A press release yesterday from the "
"Department of Defense has confirmed plans for a series of field tests for a "
"new model of light tank, currently designated the XM7 Tankette.  A major "
"departure from previous armor doctrine, the experimental design features a "
"long-range electric engine and a state-of-the-art autoloader, recently "
"upgraded to fit a 120mm main gun.  Most notable was the confirmation of a "
"one-man crew compartment, with mention of advanced fire control and sensors "
"rendering a commander and gunner unnecessary.  According to General "
"Dabrowski, \"These aren't expected to replace the venerable Abrams, instead "
"we're expecting them to find a new niche for urban warfare.  We're hoping in "
"about a year these will cost a fourth as much as an Abrams to produce while "
"having the same level of firepower.  For the same number of soldiers it'd "
"take to crew one tank, we could have four of these all supporting each "
"other, each monitoring the situation and calling in targets.\""
msgstr ""
"実験戦車、野外試験へ - 国防総省は昨日のプレスリリースで、新型軽戦車の一連の野"
"外試験計画を確認した。現時点での指定は「XM7 Tankette」。 この実験的設計は従来"
"の装甲ドクトリンからの大きな転換で、長距離航続が可能な電動エンジンと最新鋭の"
"自動装填装置を備え、最近になって120mm主砲に対応するよう改修された。特筆すべき"
"は単座の乗員区画が確認された点で、高度な射撃統制とセンサーにより車長と砲手を"
"不要とするという。 ダブロウスキー准将は「これは由緒あるエイブラムスの代替を想"
"定していない。都市戦における新たな役割を見込んでいる。 約1年後には、同等の火"
"力を維持しつつ製造コストをエイブラムスの4分の1にできることを期待している。 同"
"じ人数の兵員で1両の戦車を運用する代わりに、これを4両相互に支援させ、各車が状"
"況を監視して目標を指示できるようになる」と述べた。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\snippets.json
msgid ""
"ROBOT TANK UNVEILED - A recent press conference has confirmed the latest "
"development in AI-driven defense systems.  Much of the details remain "
"classified, other than the new project having only recently entered early "
"testing.  \"We've refined some of the developments that went into the XM7 "
"Tankette to fit an even more compact package.\" says the update, in "
"reference to the experimental light tank program to see increased production "
"and formal adoption in the coming months.  \"We're exploring uncharted "
"territory with the autonomous fire control, nothing we've put into use so "
"far has handled anything as large as a tank cannon.  Once we have all the "
"kinks worked out we'll proceed with the next wave of trials.  We should have "
"a working dual-core AI ready by the end of the year that can handle both the "
"main gun and an M2 Browning, but for now we're focusing on the main gun.\""
msgstr ""
"ロボット戦車、お披露目 - 先日の記者会見で、AI駆動の防衛システムにおける最新開"
"発が確認された。 新プロジェクトはごく最近になって初期試験段階に入ったばかりで"
"あり、多くの詳細は依然として機密扱いとされている。 発表によれば「XM7 Tankette"
"計画で得られた技術を応用し、さらなる小型化に成功した」という。実験的軽戦車計"
"画は今後、生産拡大と正式採用に向かう見通しだ。 「自律型射撃統制は未踏の領域"
"だ。これまで運用してきたものは、戦車砲のような大口径兵器を扱ったことがない。 "
"すべての問題を解決し次第、次の試験段階に進む予定だ。今年末までには主砲とM2ブ"
"ローニングの両方を制御できるデュアルコアAIを完成させる計画だが、現時点では主"
"砲に重点を置いている」としている。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\snippets.json
msgid ""
"PATTON TANKS TO BE RESTORED - Amid rumors of war on the horizon and growing "
"unrest, a recent new briefing outlined an emergency plan to restore and "
"rearm several M60 Patton main battle tanks, with roughly two hundred "
"projected to be available across the New England region within the coming "
"weeks.  Officials refused to clarify the purpose of this rearmament program, "
"leaving speculation that the move is an unintentional confirmation of an "
"impending Chinese invasion.  According to an anonymous source within the "
"military, \"They don't expect them to be facing Type 96 or 99 tanks.  "
"They'll likely be used to engage IFVs such as the Type 08 or the Type 15 "
"light tank.\""
msgstr ""
"パットン戦車、再配備へ - 戦争の兆しをめぐる噂と高まる不安のなか、先日の記者会"
"見で緊急計画が明らかにされた。それによれば、複数のM60パットン主力戦車を修復・"
"再武装し、今後数週間のうちにニューイングランド各地でおよそ200両を展開可能にす"
"るという。 当局はこの再武装計画の目的について明言を避けたが、中国による侵攻が"
"差し迫っていることの暗黙の確認ではないかとの憶測を呼んでいる。 軍内部の匿名の"
"情報源によれば「M60パットンは96式や99式戦車と相対することは想定していない。お"
"そらくは08式歩兵戦闘車や15式軽戦車といった車両に対処するために用いられるだろ"
"う」とのことだ。"

